#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid "This data will never be shared with third parties."
msgstr "Data hii haitashirikiwa kamwe na wahusika wengine."

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"We store and process your data only for the purpose of initiating "
"communication with you and for planning studies at the Max Planck Institute "
"for Empirical Aesthetics (MPIEA)."
msgstr ""
"Tunahifadhi na kuchakata data yako tu kwa madhumuni ya kuanzisha mawasiliano"
" nawe na kwa ajili ya kupanga masomo katika Taasisi ya Max Planck for "
"Empirical Aesthetics (MPIEA)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"All connections between your computer and the web server are encrypted."
msgstr ""
"Miunganisho yote kati ya kompyuta yako na seva ya wavuti imesimbwa kwa njia "
"fiche."

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"The data entered in the form you fill out are transferred in encrypted form "
"to an internal server."
msgstr ""
"Data iliyoingizwa katika fomu unayojaza huhamishwa kwa njia iliyosimbwa kwa "
"seva ya ndani."

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"We take all necessary technical and organizational security measures to "
"protect your personal data from loss and abuse."
msgstr ""
"Tunachukua hatua zote muhimu za kiufundi na usalama za shirika ili kulinda "
"data yako ya kibinafsi dhidi ya upotevu na matumizi mabaya."

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"We will then send you an e-mail with a confirmation link to verify your "
"e-mail address."
msgstr ""
"Kisha tutakutumia barua pepe yenye kiungo cha kuthibitisha ili kuthibitisha "
"anwani yako ya barua pepe."

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"Your data are stored in a secure operating environment that is not "
"accessible to the public."
msgstr ""
"Data yako huhifadhiwa katika mazingira salama ya uendeshaji ambayo hayawezi "
"kufikiwa na umma."

