#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid ""
"If you satisfactorily complete the study, we compensate you for your "
"participation:"
msgstr "Ukikamilisha utafiti kwa kuridhisha, tutakufidia kwa ushiriki wako:"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid "We appreciate your contribution to science!"
msgstr "Tunathamini mchango wako kwa sayansi!"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid ""
"You may also receive an additional payment based on your performance in the "
"task."
msgstr ""
"Unaweza pia kupokea malipo ya ziada kulingana na utendaji wako katika kazi."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"The purpose of this project is to study how people from different places in "
"the world experience sounds (e.g., speech, music) and images (e.g., faces, "
"color)."
msgstr ""
"Madhumuni ya mradi huu ni kujifunza jinsi watu kutoka sehemu mbalimbali "
"duniani wanavyopata sauti (k.m., hotuba, muziki) na picha (k.m., nyuso, "
"rangi)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid "Confidentiality"
msgstr "Usiri"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/voluntary_with_no_compensation_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid "Compensation"
msgstr "Fidia"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-benefits"
msgid ""
"Although it may not directly benefit you, this study may benefit society by "
"helping us understanding how humans derive information from sound and "
"vision, and potentially to help engineer machines that can replicate our "
"abilities (e.g. in sound recognition and computer vision) and to help "
"improve perceptual abilities in people whose hearing or sight is impaired."
msgstr ""
"Ingawa huenda usikufaidi moja kwa moja, utafiti huu unaweza kunufaisha jamii"
" kwa kutusaidia kuelewa jinsi wanadamu hupata taarifa kutoka kwa sauti na "
"kuona, na uwezekano wa kusaidia mashine za kihandisi zinazoweza kuiga uwezo "
"wetu (k.m. katika utambuzi wa sauti na maono ya kompyuta) na kusaidia "
"kuboresha. uwezo wa utambuzi kwa watu ambao kusikia au kuona kunaharibika."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-benefits"
msgid "Benefits"
msgstr "Faida"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid ""
"For the purpose of helping scientific progress and replication, sometimes we"
" may share the data with research collaborators."
msgstr ""
"Kwa madhumuni ya kusaidia maendeleo ya kisayansi na urudufishaji, wakati "
"mwingine tunaweza kushiriki data na washirika wa utafiti."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid ""
"In these cases, we will only share fully anonymized data, such as "
"demographic, aggregated, or extracted data without any personal identifiers."
msgstr ""
"Katika hali hizi, tutashiriki tu data ambayo haijatambulishwa kikamilifu, "
"kama vile data ya demografia, iliyojumlishwa au iliyotolewa bila "
"vitambulishi vyovyote vya kibinafsi."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid "Research collaborations"
msgstr "Ushirikiano wa utafiti"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"All of the information we obtain during the research will be kept "
"confidential."
msgstr "Taarifa zote tunazopata wakati wa utafiti zitawekwa siri."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Although researchers will not use your alpha numeric code to derive your "
"real identity, this record could be linked in some cases to your public "
"profile page if a data breach takes place."
msgstr ""
"Ingawa watafiti hawatatumia msimbo wako wa nambari kupata utambulisho wako "
"halisi, rekodi hii inaweza kuunganishwa katika baadhi ya matukio kwenye "
"ukurasa wa wasifu wako wa umma ikiwa ukiukaji wa data utafanyika."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid "Consenting to these additional requirements is also fully voluntary."
msgstr "Kukubali mahitaji haya ya ziada pia ni kwa hiari kikamilifu."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"If an experiment is collecting data that cannot be fully anonymized, we will"
" inform you and also ask for additional consent."
msgstr ""
"Ikiwa jaribio linakusanya data ambayo haiwezi kufichuliwa kabisa, "
"tutakujulisha na pia tutakuomba idhini ya ziada."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"No personal identifiers (e.g. your name or contact data) will be collected "
"or used at any stage of the experiment."
msgstr ""
"Hakuna vitambulishi vya kibinafsi (k.m. jina lako au data ya anwani) "
"vitakusanywa au kutumika katika hatua yoyote ya jaribio."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"These include experiments where we make audio-visual recordings or where we "
"need your contact details to contact you in the future to take another "
"experiment."
msgstr ""
"Haya ni pamoja na majaribio ambapo tunatengeneza rekodi za sauti na "
"mwonekano au tunapohitaji maelezo yako ya mawasiliano kuwasiliana nawe "
"katika siku zijazo ili kufanya jaribio lingine."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"This code will not be used to derive your real identity, will not be shared "
"with anyone outside of the research team and will be deleted after use."
msgstr ""
"Msimbo huu hautatumika kupata utambulisho wako halisi, hautashirikiwa na mtu"
" yeyote nje ya timu ya utafiti na utafutwa baada ya matumizi."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid "Thus, the experimental data is anonymous."
msgstr "Kwa hivyo, data ya majaribio haijulikani."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Thus, you may wish to restrict what information you choose to share "
"publicly."
msgstr ""
"Kwa hivyo, unaweza kutaka kuzuia ni maelezo gani unayochagua kushiriki "
"hadharani."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"We may collect some demographic data (e.g. age, gender, country of "
"residence) as well as information about your learning and exposure history "
"(e.g. musical experience playing an instrument, years of formal education, "
"languages spoken)."
msgstr ""
"Tunaweza kukusanya baadhi ya data ya demografia (k.m. umri, jinsia, nchi "
"unakoishi) pamoja na maelezo kuhusu historia yako ya kujifunza na kufichua "
"(k.m. uzoefu wa muziki wa kucheza ala, miaka ya elimu rasmi, lugha "
"zinazozungumzwa)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"We will only save your anonymized alpha numeric code in our system, in order"
" to distinguish participants who have already taken part in this or other "
"experiments."
msgstr ""
"Tutahifadhi msimbo wako wa nambari wa alpha usiojulikana katika mfumo wetu, "
"ili kutofautisha washiriki ambao tayari wameshiriki katika hili au majaribio"
" mengine."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"Finally, in some experiments you may be asked to make a voice or video "
"recording, for example, you may be asked to record your finger-tapping in "
"response to a sound or video, or to record yourself speaking or singing."
msgstr ""
"Hatimaye, katika baadhi ya majaribio unaweza kuombwa kurekodi sauti au "
"video, kwa mfano, unaweza kuombwa kurekodi kugonga vidole kwa kujibu sauti "
"au video, au kujirekodi ukizungumza au kuimba."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"For example, you may be asked to judge how pleasant a particular sound or an"
" image is, or to categorize sounds or images (e.g., if a sound or an image "
"is that of a car or a cow), or to judge other basic features of sounds or "
"images (e.g., how frequently do you encounter this type of sound or image? "
"how aesthetically pleasing you consider a particular sound or image?)."
msgstr ""
"Kwa mfano, unaweza kuulizwa kutathmini jinsi sauti au taswira fulani "
"inavyopendeza, au kuainisha sauti au picha (k.m., ikiwa sauti au taswira ni "
"ya gari au ng'ombe), au kuhukumu vipengele vingine vya msingi. ya sauti au "
"picha (k.m., ni mara ngapi unakutana na aina hii ya sauti au taswira? jinsi "
"unavyozingatia urembo au sauti fulani?)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"If the experiment will contain these elements we will ask for an additional "
"consent."
msgstr "Ikiwa jaribio litakuwa na vipengele hivi tutaomba idhini ya ziada."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"If you volunteer to participate in this study, you will be asked to perform "
"simple tasks using your keyboard or mouse while listening to sounds, or "
"while observing images or videos."
msgstr ""
"Ukijitolea kushiriki katika utafiti huu, utaombwa kufanya kazi rahisi kwa "
"kutumia kibodi au kipanya chako unaposikiliza sauti, au unapotazama picha au"
" video."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"In some experiments, we may use mild deception, i.e., we may not explain the"
" full truth regarding an experimental task (for example we will not tell you"
" that an image was generated by an artificial computer system and not a "
"human)."
msgstr ""
"Katika baadhi ya majaribio, tunaweza kutumia udanganyifu mdogo, yaani, "
"hatuwezi kueleza ukweli kamili kuhusu kazi ya majaribio (kwa mfano "
"hatutakuambia kuwa picha ilitolewa na mfumo wa kompyuta bandia na si "
"mwanadamu)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"Mild deception will only be used in some experiments where we need to "
"prevent biasing the participants before taking the experiment."
msgstr ""
"Udanganyifu mdogo utatumika tu katika baadhi ya majaribio ambapo tunahitaji "
"kuzuia kupendelea washiriki kabla ya kufanya jaribio."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid "Procedure"
msgstr "Utaratibu"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"The specific sounds, images, and videos used will vary, but may include: "
"recordings of ambient sounds, noise-bursts, speech, music, simple tones, "
"naturalistic images, animated images, comics, faces, objects, geometric "
"shapes, fractal images, or videos of natural environments."
msgstr ""
"Sauti, picha na video mahususi zitakazotumika zitatofautiana, lakini "
"zinaweza kujumuisha: rekodi za sauti tulivu, milipuko ya kelele, matamshi, "
"muziki, toni rahisi, picha za asili, picha za uhuishaji, vichekesho, nyuso, "
"vitu, maumbo ya kijiometri, picha ndogo, au video za mazingira asilia."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "Kusudi"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid "For the Max-Planck-Society, this is:"
msgstr "Kwa Max-Planck-Society, hii ni:"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid ""
"Note that in some studies data deletion will not be possible, in this case "
"we will ask you specifically to consent to this procedure in a separate "
"consent form."
msgstr ""
"Kumbuka kwamba katika baadhi ya tafiti kufuta data haitawezekana, katika "
"kesi hii tutakuomba mahususi ukubali idhini ya utaratibu huu katika fomu "
"tofauti ya idhini."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid ""
"You also have the right to submit an objection to the supervisory authority."
msgstr "Pia una haki ya kuwasilisha pingamizi kwa mamlaka ya usimamizi."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid ""
"You have the right to information regarding the data relating to you that is"
" stored at the Max-Planck-Institute, the right to correct inaccurate data, "
"and the right to demand the deletion of data in cases of inadmissible data "
"storage and the right to data portability."
msgstr ""
