msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"You may wish to make sure that no sounds/visual material in your environment"
" could be linked to your personal information. In addition, while you "
"perform a recording, the microphone or camera can capture unintended audio "
"or video, for example the camera can capture another family member, or the "
"microphone can capture something you say to another person."
msgstr ""
"Unaweza kutaka kuhakikisha kuwa hakuna sauti/nyenzo za kuona katika "
"mazingira yako zinazoweza kuunganishwa na maelezo yako ya kibinafsi. Kwa "
"kuongeza, unaporekodi, maikrofoni au kamera inaweza kunasa sauti au video "
"isiyotarajiwa, kwa mfano kamera inaweza kunasa mwanafamilia mwingine, au "
"maikrofoni inaweza kunasa kitu unachomwambia mtu mwingine."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Your recordings will not be associated with your name or other identifiers "
"in any way."
msgstr ""
"Rekodi zako hazitahusishwa na jina lako au vitambulishi vingine kwa njia "
"yoyote."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Your recordings will not be used to derive your real identity, and they will"
" not be made public."
msgstr ""
"Rekodi zako hazitatumika kupata utambulisho wako halisi, na hazitawekwa wazi"
" kwa umma."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-consent"
msgid ""
"By consenting to participate, you acknowledge that you are 18 years or "
"older, have read this consent form, agree to its contents, and agree to take"
" part in this research."
msgstr ""
"Kwa kukubali kushiriki, unakubali kuwa una umri wa miaka 18 au zaidi, "
"umesoma fomu hii ya idhini, unakubali yaliyomo, na unakubali kushiriki "
"katika utafiti huu."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-consent"
msgid "Consent"
msgstr "Idhini"

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-consent"
msgid "If you do not wish to consent, please close this page."
msgstr "Ikiwa hutaki kukubali, tafadhali funga ukurasa huu."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-contact"
msgid "Contact information"
msgstr "Maelezo ya mawasiliano"

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-overview"
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Muhtasari"

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-overview"
msgid ""
"The purpose of this online form is to give you information to help you "
"decide whether you want to take part in a research study."
msgstr ""
"Madhumuni ya fomu hii ya mtandaoni ni kukupa maelezo ya kukusaidia kuamua "
"kama ungependa kushiriki katika utafiti wa utafiti."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-overview"
msgid ""
"This research is being conducted by researchers at the Max-Planck-Institute "
"for Empirical Aesthetics."
msgstr ""
"Utafiti huu unafanywa na watafiti katika Taasisi ya Max-Planck ya Epirical "
"Aesthetics."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"Specifically, we aim to combine a wide range of behavioural methodologies to"
" characterize the ways in which people from diverse backgrounds internalize "
"and process external conditions, both in the auditory (e.g., speech, music) "
"and visual (e.g., faces, color) domains."
msgstr ""
"Hasa, tunalenga kuchanganya mbinu mbalimbali za kitabia ili kubainisha njia "
"ambazo watu kutoka asili tofauti huweka ndani na kuchakata hali za nje, zote"
" katika vikoa vya kusikia (k.m., hotuba, muziki) na taswira (k.m., nyuso, "
"rangi)."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"The purpose of this project is to study the role of experience and exposure "
"in creating and affecting our perception, decisions and actions."
msgstr ""
"Madhumuni ya mradi huu ni kusoma jukumu la uzoefu na udhihirisho katika "
"kuunda na kuathiri mtazamo wetu, maamuzi na vitendo."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"We are also interested in the way that these internal representations affect"
" human decision making and behaviour."
msgstr ""
"Pia tunavutiwa na jinsi uwakilishi huu wa ndani unavyoathiri ufanyaji "
"maamuzi na tabia ya binadamu."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"Audio-visual material will not be indexed by personal information but will "
"be linked to personal information by a key (such as “afasd12314asdasd”)."
msgstr ""
"Nyenzo za sauti na kuona hazitaorodheshwa na taarifa za kibinafsi lakini "
"zitaunganishwa na maelezo ya kibinafsi kwa ufunguo (kama vile "
"\"afasd12314asdasd\")."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"During data collection, audio-visual material will be recorded on a separate"
" server."
msgstr ""
"Wakati wa kukusanya data, nyenzo za sauti na picha zitarekodiwa kwenye seva "
"tofauti."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"Personal information will be stored separately from audio-visual materials "
"and encrypted using a strong encryption protocol (such as Advanced "
"Encryption Standard)."
msgstr ""
"Taarifa za kibinafsi zitahifadhiwa kando na nyenzo za sauti-kionekana na "
"kusimbwa kwa njia fiche kwa kutumia itifaki dhabiti ya usimbaji fiche (kama "
"vile Kiwango cha Usimbaji wa Hali ya Juu)."

