#: psynet/templates/macros/control.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "audio_meter_calibrate"
msgid ""
"A high decay parameter means that the signal takes a long time to decay "
"(i.e. high smoothing)."
msgstr ""
"Kigezo cha kuoza kwa juu kinamaanisha kuwa ishara inachukua muda mrefu kuoza"
" (yaani, laini ya juu)."

#: psynet/templates/macros/control.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "audio_meter_calibrate"
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "Nyaraka"

#: psynet/templates/macros/control.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "audio_meter_calibrate"
msgid "Sliders"
msgstr "Vitelezi"

#: psynet/templates/macros/control.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "audio_meter_calibrate"
msgid ""
"The <strong>decay</strong> parameters determine the amount of smoothing that"
" happens to the signal, and have units of seconds."
msgstr ""
"Vigezo vya <strong>kuoza</strong> huamua kiasi cha kulainisha kinachotokea "
"kwenye mawimbi, na kuwa na vitengo vya sekunde."

#: psynet/templates/macros/control.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "audio_meter_calibrate"
msgid ""
"The <strong>grace</strong> parameters determine how long the volume must be "
"outside the respective threshold for a warning message to be triggered."
msgstr ""
"Vigezo vya <strong>neema</strong> huamua ni muda gani sauti lazima iwe nje "
"ya kizingiti husika ili ujumbe wa onyo uanzishwe."

#: psynet/templates/macros/control.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "audio_meter_calibrate"
msgid ""
"The <strong>message duration</strong> parameters determine how long warning "
"messages are displayed for."
msgstr ""
"Vigezo vya <strong>muda wa ujumbe</strong> huamua ni muda gani ujumbe wa "
"onyo unaonyeshwa."

#: psynet/templates/macros/control.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "audio_meter_calibrate"
msgid ""
"The <strong>threshold</strong> parameters determine the point at which the "
"volume is determined to be 'too high' or 'too low'."
msgstr ""
"Vigezo vya <strong>kizingiti</strong> huamua mahali ambapo sauti "
"imebainishwa kuwa 'juu sana' au 'chini sana'."

#: psynet/templates/macros/control.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "audio_meter_calibrate"
msgid ""
"There are three decay parameters: one for the displayed audio meter, one for"
" the 'too-high' detector, and one for the 'too-low' detector."
msgstr ""
"Kuna vigezo vitatu vya uozo: kimoja cha mita ya sauti iliyoonyeshwa, kimoja "
"cha kigunduzi 'cha juu sana', na kimoja cha kigunduzi cha 'chini sana'."

